二级水平导航栏
下拉导航菜单
用ul 实现
ul{margin: 0;padding: 0;}
ul li{list-style-type:none;float:left;height: 30px;width: 115px;font: 0.9em Arial, Helvetica,sans-serif;}
ul li a{color: #FFF;width:113px;margin:0px;padding: 0,0,0,8px;text-decoration: none;display: block;background-color:#615656;line-height:29px;}
ul li ul li{height:25px;}
ul li ul li a{background-color: #666;line-height: 24px;}
ul li a:hover{background-color: #666;border-bottom:1px dashed #FF0000;}
ul li ul{visibility: hidden;}
ul li:hover ul{visibility: inherit;}
ul li ul li a:hover{background-color: #333;}
